WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue {
    color: white;
    background-color: #383943A3;
}

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.144
I mean, you could.

00:00:02.144 --> 00:00:07.043
But is 'I don't need to be sharp for orientation'
really how you want to start this?

00:00:07.159 --> 00:00:09.283
You've been trying to get here for a long time.

00:00:09.283 --> 00:00:11.176
One more night out will always exist.

00:00:11.176 --> 00:00:12.442
This first day won't.